
@{
    ViewBag.Title = "About";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/WebMaster.cshtml";
}

<div class="page_content_offset">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row clearfix">
            <div class="col-lg-12 col-sm-12 col-md-12 m_bottom_40">
                <!--left content column-->
                <div class="center-block" id="howitworks">
                    <h2>  <span>About Us</span></h2>
                </div>
                <div class="shrt-stry txt-cntr">
                    <h1 style="text-align:center;">Short Story About Our Company.</h1><br />
                    <p>
                        Company laundry is a premium laundry service company based in Bangalore. Backed by the team which has more than two decades of experience, Company has been serving the client for the past 20+years.
                        Our Two plants are fully equipped with the most modern machinery backed by a fully trained team of people who are committed to handle your laundry with utmost care. Our own plants are spread across 20,000 square feet equipped to handle 35,000 pieces of laundry every day.
                        The Expertise backed by the experience is what makes MaxClean an outstanding service provider in the industry.
                        With the experience of more than two decades, we can understand your needs and demand more than anyone in this field. So leave your worries to us along with your laundry and we will ensure your trust in us is never broken.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <br /><br /><br />
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row clearfix">
            <div class="col-lg-12 col-sm-12 col-md-12 m_bottom_40">
                <h2 class=" color_dark m_bottom_25" style="text-align:center;">FAQ</h2>
                <!--toggle-->
                <div class="accordion toggle">
                    <!--toggle item-->
                    <div class="accordion_item r_corners shadow wrapper m_bottom_05 shrt-stry1 h3">
                        <h3 class="a_title relative tr_all_hover bg_light_color_1 color_dark">
                            1. WHAT SHOULD I HAVE READY FOR THE FIRST DRIVER COLLECTION?
                            <span class="minus_icon tr_all_hover">-</span>
                            <span class="plus_icon tr_all_hover">+</span>
                        </h3>
                        <div class="bg_light_color_3 a_content" style="display: none;">
                            <p>Just your clothes – your MaxClean Experts will bring a MaxClean bag to place your loose clothes in, keeping them all together. For Dry Clean, Tumble Dry & Steam Press orders your MaxClean Expert will leave you with a reusable bag upon delivery – for all those future orders.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <!--toggle item-->
                    <div class="accordion_item r_corners shadow wrapper m_bottom_05 shrt-stry1 h3">
                        <h3 class="bg_light_color_1 color_dark a_title relative tr_all_hover">
                            2. WHAT REGIONS AND SUBURBS DO YOU COVER?
                            <span class="minus_icon tr_all_hover">-</span>
                            <span class="plus_icon tr_all_hover">+</span>
                        </h3>
                        <div class="bg_light_color_3 a_content" style="display: none;">
                            <p class="m_bottom_10">The quickest way to find out if we cover your area is, enter your postcode at www.maxcleanlaundry.in to get the latest information and pricing.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <!--toggle item-->
                    <div class="accordion_item r_corners shadow wrapper m_bottom_05 shrt-stry1 h3">
                        <h3 class="a_title relative tr_all_hover bg_light_color_1 color_dark">
                            3. HOW LONG DOES THE CLEANING TAKE?
                            <span class="minus_icon tr_all_hover">-</span>
                            <span class="plus_icon tr_all_hover">+</span>
                        </h3>
                        <div class="bg_light_color_3 a_content" style="display: none;">
                            <p>We aim to collect, clean and deliver your laundry all within 72 hours for regular order and 48 hours for express order. However we can get busy so select an available delivery time that suits you and we will return your order to you then..</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="accordion_item r_corners shadow wrapper m_bottom_05 shrt-stry1 h3">
                        <h3 class="a_title relative tr_all_hover bg_light_color_1 color_dark">
                            4. CAN I ADD EXTRA ITEMS TO MY ORDER WHEN YOU COLLECT?
                            <span class="minus_icon tr_all_hover">-</span>
                            <span class="plus_icon tr_all_hover">+</span>
                        </h3>
                        <div class="bg_light_color_3 a_content" style="display: none;">
                            <p>Yes you can – just give any extra items you have to your MaxClean Expert. Extra items will be input into our system right away.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="accordion_item r_corners shadow wrapper m_bottom_05 shrt-stry1 h3">
                        <h3 class="a_title relative tr_all_hover bg_light_color_1 color_dark">
                            5. WHEN CAN YOU COLLECT MY ORDER?
                            <span class="minus_icon tr_all_hover">-</span>
                            <span class="plus_icon tr_all_hover">+</span>
                        </h3>
                        <div class="bg_light_color_3 a_content" style="display: none;">
                            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
